## Visual system

- **Logo (2026-08-10 第十六輪; header updated 第十七輪)**: use the real wordmark `public/brand/hatc-logo.png`
 (navy + green triangle, transparent PNG) via the shared `src/components/BrandLogo.tsx`,
 NOT a text "HATC 華安泰昌". The glyph is navy: on the **white Header** render it bare
 (`chip={false}`); on the **dark Footer** it sits on a **white rounded chip** (`chip`
 default true, LP treatment). Header wordmark link keeps `aria-label=common.brandFull`
 (img `alt=""`); standalone marks (Footer) pass a real `alt`.
- Warm white, charcoal, brand navy (`#09395f`); green (`#009944`) sparing accent
 only. (Brass-gold retired 2026-08-07.) Card-based, product-forward grid.
- **Dark hero** (owner 2026-08-07, for the CFD-led homepage): deep-navy gradient
 hero with subtle grid + green glow, backed by a real reception photo. (The
 earlier "light hero / dark rejected" decision is superseded.) Deep navy also for
 the closing CTA band and footer; body sections stay warm-white.
- Radius 0–12px for surfaces, `--radius-pill` for buttons/badges/tabs. Purposeful
 motion allowed: counters, scroll-reveal, hover lift. Subtle navy gradients +
 soft brand-tinted shadows OK (no neon/glow).
- Never use: Vantage orange / non-brand system colour, glassmorphism, glowing
 gold, floating 3D coins, full-screen candlestick backgrounds, AI/fake photos,
 generic fintech slogans, fabricated award/user-count/testimonial claims, or
 unverified spreads/leverage/performance figures. (Gold CFD as a business line is
 allowed per 2026-08-07 owner decision; specific numbers still need owner sign-off.)
- Homepage leads with product/education/process; company facts are supporting,
 not dominant. Real certificates, office and Hong Kong imagery preferred.

## Development placeholders (owner decision 2026-08-07)

- 業主指示：**開發階段可先放示範內容以推進 UI**——可用**示範/佔位的交易數字**
  （槓桿／點差／手數／手續費／平台）、做**競品式版型**（點差比較表、統計數字帶等），
  以及**佔位圖／設計圖形**。目的：先把版面做出來，業主之後再逐步調整數字。
- **落地方式**：這類值一律當**可編輯的示範佔位**（程式碼與 UI 標為 sample/示範，集中易改），
  不是最終定案。**上線前**所有對外數字與素材須由業主確認替換（業主原話「之後我會慢慢調整數字」）。
- **仍不建議**：把明顯像真、未經業主確認的數字或**假冒真實 HATC 辦公室／證書的圖**當成
  已定案正式內容直接上線，以免誤導真實客戶；競品的**具體數據/獎項/見證**勿逐字照抄為 HATC 事實。
